      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "All sizes use two squares. Size is controlled by the number of rounds per square. XS: 7-round squares (approx 30 cm). S: 7 rounds. M: 8-round squares (approx 35 cm). L: 9 rounds (approx 39 cm). XL: 10 rounds (approx 43 cm). 2XL: 11 rounds (approx 47 cm). Side seam length is always one third of the square edge length."
          }
        ]
      },
