            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Block both squares. Lay them with right sides facing up and one long edge of each touching. Work a slip stitch seam from each outer corner inward for the side seam length. Leave the remaining central section open. Repeat on the other long edge. Work dc around sleeve openings and the back edge."
          }
        ]
